From: FIRERED project
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add permanent event-ticket deliveryman to Pallet Town

Reference target: pret/pokefirered

This creates an always-available in-game replacement for limited external
distribution. The NPC exists from the beginning of the game and gives only
tickets missing from the player's Key Items pocket.

Ferry usability remains controlled by normal Seagallop story progression.
PATCH 1/3 makes possession of the ticket item the only event-island
entitlement check.

--- a/data/maps/PalletTown/map.json
+++ b/data/maps/PalletTown/map.json
@@
   "object_events": [
+    {
+      "local_id": "LOCALID_PALLET_EVENT_DELIVERYMAN",
+      "type": "object",
+      "graphics_id": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MG_DELIVERYMAN",
+      "x": 8,
+      "y": 11,
+      "elevation": 3,
+      "movement_type": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_RIGHT",
+      "movement_range_x": 0,
+      "movement_range_y": 0,
+      "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NONE",
+      "trainer_sight_or_berry_tree_id": "0",
+      "script": "PalletTown_EventScript_EventTicketDeliveryman",
+      "flag": "0"
+    },
     {
       "local_id": "LOCALID_PALLET_SIGN_LADY",

--- a/data/maps/PalletTown/scripts.inc
+++ b/data/maps/PalletTown/scripts.inc
@@
 .equ SIGN_LADY_READY, VAR_TEMP_2
+
+PalletTown_EventScript_EventTicketDeliveryman::
+	lock
+	faceplayer
+	checkitem ITEM_AURORA_TICKET, 1
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PalletTown_EventScript_GiveAuroraTicket
+	checkitem ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET, 1
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PalletTown_EventScript_GiveMysticTicket
+	msgbox PalletTown_Text_EventDeliverymanAlreadyDelivered
+	release
+	end
+
+PalletTown_EventScript_GiveAuroraTicket::
+	checkitemspace ITEM_AURORA_TICKET, 1
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PalletTown_EventScript_EventTicketBagFull
+	giveitem ITEM_AURORA_TICKET
+	checkitem ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET, 1
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PalletTown_EventScript_EventTicketsDelivered
+
+PalletTown_EventScript_GiveMysticTicket::
+	checkitemspace ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET, 1
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PalletTown_EventScript_EventTicketBagFull
+	giveitem ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET
+
+PalletTown_EventScript_EventTicketsDelivered::
+	msgbox PalletTown_Text_EventDeliverymanDelivered
+	release
+	end
+
+PalletTown_EventScript_EventTicketBagFull::
+	msgbox PalletTown_Text_EventDeliverymanBagFull
+	release
+	end
+
+PalletTown_Text_EventDeliverymanDelivered:
+	.string "I have two special tickets for you.\\p"
+	.string "Keep them safe. When the proper ferry\\n"
+	.string "route opens, they'll take you somewhere\\l"
+	.string "very unusual.$"
+
+PalletTown_Text_EventDeliverymanAlreadyDelivered:
+	.string "I've already delivered both special\\n"
+	.string "tickets addressed to you.$"
+
+PalletTown_Text_EventDeliverymanBagFull:
+	.string "Your KEY ITEMS POCKET has no room.\\p"
+	.string "Make some space, then speak to me again.$"
